{"summary":"Dye everything around you in the colors of your team! Join the battle of colors!","description":"Dye Hard is a PvP game where you have to paint everything around and defeat your opponents like a paintball! \n\nGrab your spray gun, unlimited dye, and build a platoon! Capture enemy towers and bases together with your team. Paint the whole area without leaving a single blank spot in this heavy shooting game! \n\nThere are three squads varying by a color of paint: red, blue, and yellow. Each team on the map has its own base, and paint-shooting towers. Your task is to capture enemy structures by drowning opponents and the battlefield in paint! \n\nYou can paint over everything around without limits, the dye never ends! In places where the paint of your team's color is spilled, you can dive into it, and move much faster, restoring health! \n\nDye Hard Features: \n\n- Breathtaking graphics thanks to patented AI-powered Paintable If™ fluid simulation technology! \n- Simple controls\n- Unique mechanics\n- Character customization\n\nDye Hard is a colorful game with exciting paint fights with your squad! Paint everything you see around you, drown your rivals in paint, and capture enemy bases! Join the colorful shooter and start a fun game!","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.49 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yaY9opBGuyo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GyhE__ZJk6sQIltIQYvw_cV5adeBXq6VQGMH5N89NmI8pYRNr9UJMsiAjrBdeVCXpYd_muq4yj6PHdBdH39i5Q","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TNk_SVaUe4uhgzEMErcSVBUgYBkzFKtweOmo8MpEiqZUnv2qOAxD813v6SONxQnZacl6VnMXcXuDYE55V6iEUdI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qaGSOtbjPeVt06g4aGZRR_CKzOvEwtmfqkjq42A2UZJiyphrMQ_FXE4qCKn_BaBaUvQtfA6sO5dy3Y8OmZMSRw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hF7bsbo4y1NNoj8ZWfaJVsO3ExdGFwpoIZ2JyOKia1CUWyLCnpjC4Z9-MVVn7i8riAOw42zVmPMu5reZZnNkPw","https://play-lh.googleus